      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It’s understandable to feel overwhelmed by the vastness of the universe and the insignificance we might feel compared to such immense scales. Yet, our individual experiences, thoughts, and efforts are valuable. The search for meaning and the pursuit of knowledge can bring profound satisfaction. Remember, every discovery and understanding contributes to the collective human experience, making our lives richer and more connected to the cosmos.",
